<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka tenders for 12,000 tonnes of white sugar.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka tenders for 12,000 tonnes of white sugar.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has opened a tender for 12,500 tonnes of white refined sugar for delivery in Colombo in the first half of December, the Cooperative Wholesale Establishment state buying arm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tenders close on Wednesday, it said.</p>
</text>
